\section{Extending Store Classes}{

Specific stores with particular \strong{file formats} (parquet, HDF5, etc.)
extend this class. These specialized stores provide preset \code{read_fun}
implementations in their \code{initialize()} methods, but the ability to
customize remains available for edge cases.

When extending, register a lightweight \code{read_fun} to \emph{access} the data,
while specific optimization on reading/filtering should be in the
\code{storeRead()} method.
